        "owner": "T04a.2 M2b.2 with T06/T10",
        "work": "Annotation edit and import/export consumers, geometry-edit alignment and explicit source/plane mapping.",
        "exit": "Actual controls/roundtrips and atomic malformed/stale refusal across both hosts; no silent metadata loss."
      }
    ],
    "no_action": "Retain bounded metadata passes and owned binding copies for safe lifetime; no speculative scan elimination, additional cache/runtime/SDK generation, or whole-environment archive."
